  /* $9D3A -- `LD L,(IY+6) / LD H,0 / ADD HL,HL x2 / LD A,(IY+5) / CALL $9F5C /
     LD E,A / LD D,$58 / ADD HL,DE`: the attribute cell as $5800 + Y*4 + (X >> 3).
     Y*4, NOT (Y & $F8)*4 -- the two agree only because $9E21 aligns a fireball's
     Y; MEASURED on a built unaligned one. */
